OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thu 12 Nov to Sat 21 NovFAt
OL,6,Fthe start of this period, outbreaks of
OL,7,Frain across the south of the UK will
OL,8,Fclear away as clearer conditions
OL,9,Fspread from the north. A few wintry
OL,10,Fshowers are likely in the far north,
OL,11,Fbut otherwise this will mean a spell
OL,12,Fof fine and dry weather developing for
OL,13,Fmost areas at the end of next week and
OL,14,Fthe weekend. Over the following week,
OL,15,Fa change to more changeable weather is
OL,16,Flikely, with Atlantic frontal systems
OL,17,Fbringing rain and some strong winds.
OL,18,FAfter a cold start, temperatures will
OL,19,Fprobably be above average overall.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
